  general, the main list.

It is our tradition to have a room at
http://www.lojban.org/tiki/jbonunsla that everybody sleeps in.  For
complex reasons, that's not actually going to happen; 4 of us have a
room, and 3 others have a room, and so on.

Right now there's only one person in the shared room.

But, 1 is not 0, so we likely still need to have the room.

So, come to http://www.lojban.org/tiki/jbonunsla and get a free
room!  :D

If you are coming or want to come and do not already have a room of
your own, *PLEASE* email me.

Thanks.

